{"id":"a7b32ac496bd4c80","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-am.md","title":"Arthur-Merlin Class","display":"df-am — Arthur-Merlin Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-am","aliases":["28-df-am","AM","Arthur-Merlin"],"display":"df-am — Arthur-Merlin Class","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.10","source_printed_pages":"150–151","source_pdf_pages":"176–177","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-am"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-am</span><span>AM</span><span>Arthur-Merlin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-am — Arthur-Merlin Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"150–151"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"176–177"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_t\">\\(U_t\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^t\">\\(\\Sigma^t\\)</span> 上均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>，函数输出与单比特串认同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(T\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(x,r,w)\\coloneqq T(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(r,w)))\">\\(T(x,r,w)\\coloneqq T(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(r,w)))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>验证者的全部随机选择由显式参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 提供；多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\">\\(p,q\\)</span> 的量词在下式绑定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{AM}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists T\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ [&amp;\\forall x\\in L\\ \\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^{q(|x|)}\\ T(x,r,w)=1]\\ge2/3\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^{q(|x|)}\\ T(x,r,w)=1]\\le1/3]\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{AM}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists T\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ [&amp;\\forall x\\in L\\ \\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^{q(|x|)}\\ T(x,r,w)=1]\\ge2/3\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^{q(|x|)}\\ T(x,r,w)=1]\\le1/3]\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Merlin 在看见公开随机串后选择消息；检查谓词是确定型多项式时间的，因而不存在未计入的额外私有随机币。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.10，印刷页 150–151；PDF 页 176–177。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$U_t$ 为 $\\Sigma^t$ 上均匀分布；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，函数输出与单比特串认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；对 $T\\in\\mathbf{FP}$，$T(x,r,w)\\coloneqq T(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(r,w)))$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"T(x,r,w)\\coloneqq T(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(r,w)))","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"p,q","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{AM}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists T\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ [&\\forall x\\in L\\ \\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^{q(|x|)}\\ T(x,r,w)=1]\\ge2/3\\\\&\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^{q(|x|)}\\ T(x,r,w)=1]\\le1/3]\\}.\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"交互协议：[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]、[[28-df-completeness-soundness]]、[[28-df-ip]]、[[28-df-am]]、[[28-df-ma]]、[[28-df-mip]]。"}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}